## Domain Knowledge (distilled from experience)
- Data for period X appears in bulletins published AFTER period X. January data → March bulletin. Full fiscal year → October bulletin.
- Search for TABLE NAMES ("Table FD-1", "Table ESF-1") not data values — table names are stable across decades.
- Fiscal year ends June 30 (pre-1976) or September 30 (post-1976). Calendar year ends December 31. These are NOT the same.
- Unit headers appear ABOVE the data table. Check: "(In millions)" vs "(In thousands)." A misread here means 1000x error.

